variable C41 equal 0.5*(${C4neg}+${C4pos})
variable C41 equal 0.5*(120.291296477898+${C4pos})
variable C41 equal 0.5*(120.291296477898+-120.307418283628)
variable C5${dir} equal 0.5*(${C5neg}+${C5pos})
variable C51 equal 0.5*(${C5neg}+${C5pos})
variable C51 equal 0.5*(28.923598096936+${C5pos})
variable C51 equal 0.5*(28.923598096936+-28.921469188224)
